  "paper_id": "asplos-2024-socflow-efficient-and-scalable-dnn-training-on-soc-clust-a5a3eb7d",
  "title": "SoCFlow: Efficient and Scalable DNN Training on SoC-Clustered Edge Servers",
  "abstract": "SoC-Cluster, a novel server architecture composed of massive mobile system-on-chips (SoCs), is gaining popularity in industrial edge computing due to its energy efficiency and compatibility with existing mobile applications. However, we observe that the deployed SoC-Cluster servers are not fully utilized, because the hosted workloads are mostly user-triggered and have significant tidal phenomena. To harvest the free cycles, we propose to co-locate deep learning tasks on them.",
